      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Bites. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d8 + 4) Piercing damage - or 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage if the swarm is Bloodied - plus 10 (3d6) Poison damage.",
